  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>33</mn></math>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the integral value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to _____ .",
